; A game played with an Xbox controller: the DualSense is the game's
; XInput controller 0. Cross, Circle, Square and Triangle are A, B, X and
; Y; L1/R1 the shoulders, L2/R2 the analog triggers, L3/R3 the stick
; clicks, Options Start and Create Back. No stick moves the pointer, and
; Options+Create held for a second still closes the game. Share it with
; any profile whose game reads XInput.
[input]
mode = xinput
mouse = none
